    "Id": "chassisdef_wildfire_P7-WF",
    "Name": "Wildfire",
    "Details": "The Wildfire P7-WF drops the torso mounted cockpit, returning to a standard head mounted one, and replaces one of the Machine Guns with an AMS.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Well Balanced</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
